# Backend Clean Architecture

- Feature modules under `apps/api/src/modules/<feature>/`.
- Domain: entities, repository contracts, domain errors. No Nest/Prisma/Redis.
- Application: use cases depending on contracts/ports only.
- Infrastructure: Prisma repositories, mappers, cache adapters.
- Presentation: thin controllers, Zod at the HTTP boundary, HTTP mappers.
- Bind implementations with injection tokens in the Nest module.
- See `docs/architecture/backend.md` and `.cursor/skills/create-backend-feature/SKILL.md`.
